                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "Sure, that would be fine.  Not terribly worried about it, I don't really understand the comment either way."
                },
                {
                    "file": "include/sdbusplus/asio/connection.hpp",
                    "line": 129,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Nico Brailovsky",
                        "email": "nicolasbrailo@gmail.com",
                        "username": "nicolasbrailo"
                    },
                    "message": "I'd like to leave the code in a better state I found it! Updated the comment to reflect what we're doing and (more importantly) why. If the message still isn't clear or if it's superfluous, let me know and I can iterate on it or remove it."
                }
